1. First install dbmate (https://github.com/amacneil/dbmate) on your system.

2.
On terminal tab 1 from project root:
$ python3 -m venv .venv
$ source .venv/bin/activate
$ pip install -r requirements.txt
$ flask --app task_manager init-db  # first time only
$ dbmate up     # run migrations
$ flask --app task_manager run --debug

On terminal tab 2:
dileep@dileep-HP-Pavilion-Laptop-15-eg2xxx:~/Documents/task_manager_api$ http POST 127.0.0.1:5000/auth/register username=test password=<YOUR-PASSWORD>
